#!sketch
# an entity-component system: trees for entities, flows for systems

--- arena ---

[Ship]
    \-& {Transform}
    \-& {Health}
    \-*-> [Bullet]
        \-& {Transform}
        \-& {Damage}
[Asteroid]
    \-& {Transform}
    \-{shattered}-? [Shard]

--- systems ---

[Physics] -> {Transform}
[Homing]  -> [Bullet]/{Transform}
{Damage}  -> [Combat] -> {Health}
[Combat]  ~> <Destroyed> -> [Spawner]
[Spawner] => [Shard]
